Description: Provides an R interface to the SOVEREIGN OPS 2.0
    Domain-Aware Reliability Protocol (DARP) pipeline. Calls the
    Python implementation via reticulate for contract-first anomaly
    detection with cryptographic provenance, abstention-aware
    decisions, and domain isolation enforcement.
